        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "An HD remaster of Devil May Cry, first made available in \"Devil May Cry HD Collection.\"\n\nIn the first installment of the Devil May Cry series, the player controls Dante as he faces off against the resurrected Demon Emperor, Mundus. The game introduces Dante's abilities, like Devil Trigger which transforms him into a demon, swordplay, gun-slinging, and stylish combos, all of which have become a staple of the series.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Remasterización en HD de Devil May Cry, disponible originalmente en «Devil May Cry HD Collection».\n\nEn la primera entrega de la serie Devil May Cry, el jugador controla a Dante mientras se enfrenta al Emperador Demonio resucitado, Mundus. El juego presenta las habilidades de Dante, como el Devil Trigger, que lo transforma en demonio, el manejo de la espada, el uso de pistolas y los combos con estilo, todos ellos elementos característicos de la serie.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2012",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
